      "message": "AFAIU, the TX callback is generated from session_dequeue_notify() only after the transport dequeues bytes from the HTTP transport-session FIFO. A stalled sender with no progress therefore will not refresh the timer and will still time out. The app-TX refresh and this refresh represent different progress points. I agree that the protocol-specific callbacks are a cleaner location, so I\u0027ll move the update into the H1/H2 VFT implementations.",
